我们《办公室女士》团队的最新成员。

1394
00:57:56.690 --> 00:58:01.730
We need everyone to understand how amazing Matt Beagle is.
我们需要让每个人都明白马特·比格尔有多棒。

1395
00:58:01.870 --> 00:58:06.570
Matt is just the most fantastic, calming presence.
马特简直是最棒、最令人安心的存在。

1396
00:58:07.050 --> 00:58:11.270
No matter what we need, when we need it, he's anticipated our need,
无论我们需要什么，什么时候需要，他都能预料到我们的需求，

1397
00:58:11.410 --> 00:58:12.450
and he's taking care of it.
并且他把一切都处理得妥妥当当。

1398
00:58:12.590 --> 00:58:16.770
Matt, I hope your family knows what a badass you are.
马特，我希望你的家人知道你有多厉害。

1399
00:58:17.050 --> 00:58:22.090
You're a treasure, and you will do things that are just so near and dear to my heart,
你是个宝贝，你做的事情总是深深触动我的心，

1400
00:58:22.710 --> 00:58:28.070
which is like before every Zoom that we have, you will set out an agenda in a Google Doc,
比如在我们每次开Zoom会议之前，你都会在谷歌文档里列出议程，

1401
00:58:28.270 --> 00:58:33.130
but you have links to all the other Google Docs that we might need to reference.
但你里面有我们可能需要参考的所有其他谷歌文档的链接。

1402
00:58:33.130 --> 00:58:35.950
Like, maybe we will, maybe we won't, but it's there.
就好像，也许我们会用，也许不会，但它就在那儿。

1403
00:58:36.090 --> 00:58:37.350
It's all in one document.
全都在一个文档里。

1404
00:58:37.650 --> 00:58:39.090
Here's another thing Matt will do.
马特还会做另一件事。

1405
00:58:39.390 --> 00:58:41.630
He knew I was taking a road trip with Josh.
他知道我要和乔什去公路旅行。

1406
00:58:41.830 --> 00:58:45.950
He knew we had an edit coming up and that I wouldn't be able to access it in a computer,
他知道我们接下来有个剪辑工作，而且我无法在电脑上访问它，

1407
00:58:46.350 --> 00:58:47.370
like in a Google Doc.
比如在谷歌文档里。

1408
00:58:47.470 --> 00:58:48.730
So he texted it to me.
所以他把它发短信给我了。

1409
00:58:48.830 --> 00:58:51.850
Hey, Ange, in case you want to listen on your car ride.
嘿，安吉，以防你想在车上听。

1410
00:58:51.990 --> 00:58:53.270
I was like, that's amazing.
当时我就想，这太棒了。

1411
00:58:54.270 --> 00:58:54.630
Amazing.
太棒了。

1412
00:58:55.170 --> 00:58:55.850
Well, thank you.
嗯，谢谢你。

1413
00:58:56.110 --> 00:58:57.710
Can I stop following Sam, too?
我也能取消关注萨姆吗？

1414
00:58:57.710 --> 00:59:01.650
I'm always following Sam after he's like read some poetry or a letter or something.
每次萨姆读完一首诗或一封信什么的之后，我都得关注他。

1415
00:59:03.490 --> 00:59:04.210
I know.
我知道。

1416
00:59:04.330 --> 00:59:06.010
He has such a rich history here.
他在这里有着如此丰富的故事。

1417
00:59:06.250 --> 00:59:07.190
Can I go first next time?
下次我能先来吗？

1418
00:59:07.310 --> 00:59:07.790
I'm kidding.
我开玩笑呢。

1419
00:59:08.270 --> 00:59:08.750
Congratulations.
恭喜。

1420
00:59:09.170 --> 00:59:11.310
This is just such a special place to be.
这里真的是一个非常特别的地方。

1421
00:59:11.410 --> 00:59:16.510
I feel so lucky to be part of this team and family and history, and I'm just thrilled
能成为这个团队、这个大家庭和这段历史的一部分，我感到非常幸运，我也非常激动

1422
00:59:16.510 --> 00:59:20.230
to be here, and I'm super excited for everyone involved for this milestone.
能来到这里，并且为所有参与这一里程碑的人感到无比兴奋。

1423
00:59:20.410 --> 00:59:21.510
So thank you to everyone.
所以谢谢大家。

1424
00:59:21.750 --> 00:59:22.330
Thanks, Matt.
谢谢你，马特。

1425
00:59:22.590 --> 00:59:22.850
Yeah.
对。

1426
00:59:23.070 --> 00:59:25.450
We're so glad you're a part of this team as well.
我们也非常高兴你能成为这个团队的一员。

1427
00:59:25.730 --> 00:59:26.110
Yeah.
对。

1428
00:59:26.310 --> 00:59:27.090
From day one.
从第一天起。

1429
00:59:27.090 --> 00:59:27.850
From day one.
从第一天起。

1430
