What's Command F?
什么是查找快捷键？

1436
00:59:41.050 --> 00:59:42.470
We had never heard of it.
我们以前从来没听说过。

1437
00:59:42.470 --> 00:59:44.190
We'd never heard of Command F.
我们从没听说过查找快捷键。

1438
00:59:44.270 --> 00:59:46.590
So now that we call you our Command F.
所以现在我们叫你我们的“查找键”。

1439
00:59:46.750 --> 00:59:46.970
Yeah.
对。

1440
00:59:47.090 --> 00:59:50.670
Because you help us find everything and figure everything out.
因为你帮我们找到了所有东西，搞定了一切。

1441
00:59:51.010 --> 00:59:54.710
And you might have a coffee mug waiting for you here that says Command F.
而且这里可能有个印着“查找键”的咖啡杯在等着你呢。

1442
00:59:55.130 --> 00:59:55.530
Might?
可能？

1443
00:59:55.530 --> 00:59:57.250
I know that you do.
我知道肯定有。

